[l_english.future_facility]
Frontier Technology Lab

[l_english.future_facility_desc]
Frontier Technology Labs allow you to start research projects on various advanced technologies such as computers, new materials, automated machinery, clean energy, etc.
§RThere are no frontier technology research projects in the current version.§!

[l_english.future_facility_plural]
Frontier Technology Labs

